   "licenseNote": "as stated in SuttaCentral publication metadata (bilara-data _publication-v2.json); the translator additionally requests that use not be for AI training datasets, AI models or AI-derived technologies",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "Today you’re like a withered leaf,"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "Yama’s men await you."
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "You stand at the departure gates,"
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "yet you have no supplies for the road."
    },
    {
     "n": 5,
     "text": "Make an island of yourself!"
    },
    {
     "n": 6,
     "text": "Swiftly strive, learn to be wise!"
    },
    {
     "n": 7,
     "text": "Purged of stains, flawless,"
    },
    {
     "n": 8,
     "text": "you’ll go to the heavenly realm of the noble ones."
    },
    {
     "n": 9,
     "text": "You’ve journeyed the stages of life,"
    },
    {
     "n": 10,
     "text": "and now you set out to meet Yama."
    },
    {
     "n": 11,
     "text": "Along the way there’s nowhere to stay,"
    },
    {
     "n": 12,
     "text": "yet you have no supplies for the road."
    },
    {
     "n": 13,
     "text": "Make an island of yourself!"
    },
    {
     "n": 14,
     "text": "Swiftly strive, learn to be wise!"
    },
    {
     "n": 15,
     "text": "Purged of stains, flawless,"
    },
    {
     "n": 16,
     "text": "you’ll not come again to rebirth and old age."
    },
    {
     "n": 17,
     "text": "A smart person would purge"
    },
    {
     "n": 18,
     "text": "their own stains gradually,"
    },
    {
     "n": 19,
     "text": "bit by bit, moment by moment,"
    },
    {
     "n": 20,
     "text": "like a smith smelting silver."
    },
    {
     "n": 21,
     "text": "It is the rust born on the iron"
    },
    {
     "n": 22,
     "text": "that eats away the place it arose."
    },
    {
     "n": 23,
     "text": "And so it is their own deeds"
    },
    {
     "n": 24,
     "text": "that lead the overly-ascetic to a bad place."
    },
    {
     "n": 25,
     "text": "Not rehearsing is the stain of hymns."
    },
    {
     "n": 26,
     "text": "The stain of houses is neglect."
    },
    {
     "n": 27,
     "text": "Laziness is the stain of beauty."
    },
    {
     "n": 28,
     "text": "A guard’s stain is negligence."
    },
    {
     "n": 29,
     "text": "Misconduct is a woman’s stain."
    },
    {
     "n": 30,
     "text": "A giver’s stain is stinginess."
    },
    {
     "n": 31,
     "text": "Bad qualities are a stain"
    },
    {
     "n": 32,
     "text": "in this world and the next."
    },
    {
     "n": 33,
     "text": "But a worse stain than these"
    },
    {
     "n": 34,
     "text": "is ignorance, the worst stain of all."
    },
    {
     "n": 35,
     "text": "Having given up that stain,"
    },
    {
     "n": 36,
     "text": "be without stains, mendicants!"
    },
    {
     "n": 37,
     "text": "Life is easy for the shameless."
    },
    {
     "n": 38,
     "text": "With all the rude courage of a crow,"
    },
    {
     "n": 39,
     "text": "they live pushy,"
    },
    {
     "n": 40,
     "text": "rude, and corrupt."
    },
    {
     "n": 41,
     "text": "Life is hard for the conscientious,"
    },
    {
     "n": 42,
     "text": "always seeking purity,"
    },
    {
     "n": 43,
     "text": "neither clinging nor rude,"
    },
    {
     "n": 44,
     "text": "pure of livelihood and discerning."
    },
    {
     "n": 45,
     "text": "Take anyone in this world"
    },
    {
     "n": 46,
     "text": "who kills living creatures,"
    },
    {
     "n": 47,
     "text": "speaks falsely, steals,"
    },
    {
     "n": 48,
     "text": "commits adultery,"
    },
    {
     "n": 49,
     "text": "and indulges in drinking"
    },
    {
     "n": 50,
     "text": "beer and wine."
    },
    {
     "n": 51,
     "text": "Right here they dig up"
    },
    {
     "n": 52,
     "text": "the root of their own self."
    },
    {
     "n": 53,
     "text": "Know this, my man:"
    },
    {
     "n": 54,
     "text": "they are unrestrained and wicked."
    },
    {
     "n": 55,
     "text": "Don’t let that greed and unrighteousness"
    },
    {
     "n": 56,
     "text": "inflict pain on you for long."
    },
    {
     "n": 57,
     "text": "The people give according to their faith,"
    },
    {
     "n": 58,
     "text": "according to their confidence."
    },
    {
     "n": 59,
     "text": "If you get upset over that,"
    },
    {
     "n": 60,
     "text": "over others’ food and drink,"
    },
    {
     "n": 61,
     "text": "you’ll not, by day or by night,"
    },
    {
     "n": 62,
     "text": "become immersed in samādhi."
    },
    {
     "n": 63,
     "text": "Those who have cut that out,"
    },
    {
     "n": 64,
     "text": "dug it up at the root, eradicated it,"
    },
    {
     "n": 65,
     "text": "they will, by day or by night,"
    },
    {
     "n": 66,
     "text": "become immersed in samādhi."
    },
    {
     "n": 67,
     "text": "There is no fire like greed,"
    },
    {
     "n": 68,
     "text": "no crime like hate,"
    },
    {
     "n": 69,
     "text": "no net like delusion,"
    },
    {
     "n": 70,
     "text": "no river like craving."
    },
    {
     "n": 71,
     "text": "It’s easy to see the faults of others,"
    },
    {
     "n": 72,
     "text": "hard to see one’s own."
    },
    {
     "n": 73,
     "text": "For the faults of others"
    },
    {
     "n": 74,
     "text": "are tossed high like hay,"
    },
    {
     "n": 75,
     "text": "while one’s own are hidden,"
    },
    {
     "n": 76,
     "text": "as a cheat hides a bad hand."
    },
    {
     "n": 77,
     "text": "When you look for the flaws of others,"
    },
    {
     "n": 78,
     "text": "always finding fault,"
    },
    {
     "n": 79,
     "text": "your defilements only grow,"
    },
    {
     "n": 80,
     "text": "you’re far from ending defilements."
    },
    {
     "n": 81,
     "text": "In the atmosphere there is no track,"
    },
    {
     "n": 82,
     "text": "there’s no true ascetic outside here."
    },
    {
     "n": 83,
     "text": "People enjoy proliferation,"
    },
    {
     "n": 84,
     "text": "the Realized Ones are free of proliferation."
    },
    {
     "n": 85,
     "text": "In the atmosphere there is no track,"
    },
    {
     "n": 86,
     "text": "there’s no true ascetic outside here."
    },
    {
     "n": 87,
     "text": "No conditions last forever,"
    },
    {
     "n": 88,
     "text": "the Awakened Ones are not shaken."
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
